WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.909 --> 00:00:04.530
The world will mark an important milestone

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:08.258
as the global population surpasses 8 billion people.

00:00:15.014 --> 00:00:16.468
Weddings are back.

00:00:16.468 --> 00:00:19.439
Experts are predicting weddings to reach a
40-year high.

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:21.917
We have been waiting to do this for two-and-a-half
years.

00:00:21.917 --> 00:00:24.666
After weeks of flirtation and fighting

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:27.214
the new couple has officially done the deed.

00:00:27.214 --> 00:00:28.781
[Laughing]

00:00:29.616 --> 00:00:31.607
Full-on crypto crash.

00:00:31.607 --> 00:00:33.954
$32 billion dollars just vanished…

00:00:33.954 --> 00:00:35.320
My money don’t jiggle jiggle.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:37.465
BTS are going on hiatus.

00:00:37.465 --> 00:00:42.785
Taylor Swift fans waited hours online only
to find the website crashing.

00:00:42.785 --> 00:00:44.423
I’m going to the concert!

00:00:45.155 --> 00:00:47.183
The final seconds before impact.

00:00:47.183 --> 00:00:47.966
[Slap]

00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.433
Have a corn-tastic day.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:50.789
Ah, stunning! Yeah.

00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:54.219
The blockbuster legal saga between Amber Heard
and Johnny Depp…

00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:56.755
My favorite thing about the movie is like,

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:57.785
it feels like a…

00:00:57.785 --> 00:00:59.185
like a… movie.

00:01:00.174 --> 00:01:05.378
The Russian president says a military operation
is now underway in eastern Ukraine.

00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:09.517
Explosions and air raid sirens ringing out
in cities across this country.

00:01:09.517 --> 00:01:12.909
Soaring new numbers from the UN on Ukrainians
fleeing the fighting.

00:01:12.909 --> 00:01:15.710
We cry — we all have the feeling that we’ve
no home.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.135
[In Russian] We are ready for any outcome.

00:01:18.135 --> 00:01:21.865
Russia, now the target of more than 2,700
new sanctions.

00:01:21.865 --> 00:01:24.420
And the world bracing for food shortages

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.439
Russia has now suspended all gas supplies
to Germany.

00:01:27.439 --> 00:01:30.990
Possible explosions along the Nord Stream
pipelines.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:34.079
Gas prices — soaring to the highest average
ever recorded.

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:34.607
Amazon,

00:01:34.607 --> 00:01:35.250
Microsoft,

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.390
Meta announced 11,000 employees laid off

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.390
[Twitter notification]

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:41.299
1,200 Twitter employees calling it quits.

00:01:41.299 --> 00:01:43.529
I quit is what’s going on.

00:01:43.529 --> 00:01:44.777
[Screaming] Ah, ****

00:01:44.777 --> 00:01:45.445
Inflation

00:01:45.445 --> 00:01:46.824
is much too high.

00:01:46.824 --> 00:01:48.210
Everything has doubled up.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.210
Do you heat or do you eat?

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.500
These prices are totally outrageous.

00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:53.956
I do not have time for this!

00:01:53.956 --> 00:01:55.188
[BeReal notification]

00:01:56.286 --> 00:02:00.249
It’s been the most incredible ride and journey
I’ve ever been on.

00:02:00.249 --> 00:02:01.790
[Cheering]

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:07.430
We have finally achieved equal pay for our
men’s and our women’s national team.

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.190
It’s about damn time.

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:12.950
It is the most controversial World Cup in
the history of football.

00:02:12.950 --> 00:02:16.640
The gulf state’s been under intense scrutiny
over the treatment of migrant workers.

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:19.000
The 2022 Winter Olympics are underway.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.840
Jamaica will compete in the four-man bobsled.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:25.410
China’s snow princess is the queen of big air!

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:28.430
Russian figure skater testing positive for
a banned substance.

00:02:28.430 --> 00:02:30.379
I have tested positive for Covid-19.

00:02:30.379 --> 00:02:32.510
I will have to withdraw.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:35.160
BA.5 is fueling yet another wave

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:38.704
Covid vaccines for children under 5 began
today.

00:02:38.704 --> 00:02:40.640
Someone’s getting vaccinated.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.362
Airline passengers can now decide for themselves
to wear a mask.

00:02:44.362 --> 00:02:47.560
Summer travel this year comes with some baggage.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:52.278
Kylie Jenner takes a three-minute flight and
yet they’re telling me to recycle cans!

00:02:52.742 --> 00:02:54.159
Soaring temperatures.

00:02:54.159 --> 00:02:55.964
40.2 degrees

00:02:55.964 --> 00:02:58.545
[Speaking Portuguese] Get out of there, please!

00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:02.510
Pakistan reeling from the devastating floods
caused by monsoon rains.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:05.000
We are on a highway to climate hell

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.150
with our foot still on the accelerator.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.290
Hurricane Ian has changed Florida forever.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:14.313
This wall could not contain it because the
water was too much.

00:03:14.313 --> 00:03:18.254
We are seeing tragedy unraveling in front
of our eyes.

00:03:18.254 --> 00:03:19.270
[Gasp]

00:03:22.422 --> 00:03:26.209
[Speaking Arabic] We were working here, and
suddenly, we heard mortar explosions near this mosque.

00:03:26.209 --> 00:03:29.822
This crater hints at the size of the explosion
in western Ghana.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:35.360
The government of Burkina Faso averted a plot
to take over the country.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:40.460
Today, we have fought for our freedom from
the greedy politicians.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:44.040
154 people were killed in a crush in South Korea.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:45.843
Another mass shooting…

00:03:45.843 --> 00:03:47.043
At a fourth of July parade,

00:03:47.043 --> 00:03:47.919
In a Walmart,

00:03:47.919 --> 00:03:49.043
At a hospital complex,

00:03:49.043 --> 00:03:50.043
At a gay nightclub,

00:03:50.043 --> 00:03:52.010
An elementary school in Uvalde, Texas.

00:03:52.010 --> 00:03:53.849
They let our baby get slaughtered.

00:03:53.849 --> 00:03:58.158
A major Supreme Court ruling that could make
it easier to obtain a firearm license.

00:03:58.158 --> 00:03:59.560
Antisemitic incidents…

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:01.920
Black transgender deaths are rising.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:04.010
Critics call it the “don’t say gay” bill.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.844
We will not go back!

00:04:05.844 --> 00:04:09.950
The nation’s highest court ruling to overturn Roe v. Wade.

00:04:09.950 --> 00:04:11.607
Our body, our choice!

00:04:11.607 --> 00:04:16.450
22-year-old Mahsa Amini was taken into custody
by Iran’s morality police.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.192
Amini’s death has sparked outrage.

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:23.919
The Iranian squad chose not to sing the country’s
national anthem.

00:04:23.919 --> 00:04:29.729
Please be our voice and don’t let the evil
regime kill innocent people.

00:04:29.729 --> 00:04:32.830
Palestinian journalist Shireen Abu Akleh has
been shot dead.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.990
Thousands gathered for her funeral procession.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.380
[Chanting in Mandarin] Not lies, but respect!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:42.200
Authorities in China are strengthening their
efforts to stamp out unrest over stringent

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.200
Covid measures.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.397
[Speaking Ukrainian] The citizens are here.

00:04:45.397 --> 00:04:47.030
We are here.

00:04:47.030 --> 00:04:50.940
[Piano music]

00:04:51.373 --> 00:04:56.500
I want you to know how sad I am to be giving
up the best job in the world.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.520
I am resigning as leader of the conservative party.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.130
I am prepared to give everything I have.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:06.770
Xi Jinping — becomes the most powerful leader
in China in decades.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:11.020
Jair Bolsonaro defeated by former president
Lula da Silva.

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:14.419
Gabriel Boric will become Chile’s youngest
ever president.

00:05:14.419 --> 00:05:18.230
Republicans were hoping for a red wave, which
didn’t really pan out.

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:22.095
Giorgia Meloni’s “Brothers of Italy”
party winning this weekend’s election.

00:05:22.095 --> 00:05:26.205
India’s first tribal person elected to the
highest office of the land.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:31.930
Buckingham Palace has announced the death
of her majesty Queen Elizabeth the second.

00:05:32.501 --> 00:05:33.547
[Canon fire]

00:05:36.701 --> 00:05:39.365
This is the end of an era.

00:05:44.853 --> 00:05:47.180
Ukrainian forces are now on the offensive.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:51.860
They’ve taken more territory in the past
week than Russia has since April.

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:53.580
Nobody’s gonna break us.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.092
We are strong.

00:05:55.092 --> 00:05:56.573
We are Ukrainians.

00:05:56.573 --> 00:05:59.410
WNBA star Brittney Griner is headed home.

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:01.860
I’m about to sign the Inflation Reduction Act…

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.150
…The largest US commitment ever to fighting climate change.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.981
Cuba holding a landmark referendum to legalize
same-sex marriage.

00:06:11.485 --> 00:06:12.280
Yes!

00:06:16.515 --> 00:06:17.625
[Speaking Spanish] Argentina!

00:06:17.625 --> 00:06:20.000
Champions of the world!

00:06:24.641 --> 00:06:31.580
Every image is a new discovery and each will
give humanity a view of the universe that

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.270
we’ve never seen before.

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:38.340
Thank you to the Academy for letting our Coda
make history tonight.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:42.860
And don’t you ever, ever give up on you.

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:45.979
It is a long journey to this moment.

00:06:45.979 --> 00:06:52.520
In my family, it took just one generation
to go from segregation to the Supreme Court

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.682
of the United States.

00:06:54.682 --> 00:07:00.000
History is not about statistics and memorizing
dates and boring quotations.

00:07:01.587 --> 00:07:03.446
History is about people.

00:07:03.446 --> 00:07:04.997
It’s about human beings.

